sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS configured for central cost calculation
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports payments using dynamic QR codes
    Note over CS: Test System has:<br>WebPaymentsCtrlr.Enabled is true<br>WebPaymentsCtrlr.URLTemplate is <base-url>/{chargingstationid}/{evse}/{totp}/{version}<br>WebPaymentsCtrlr.ValidityTime is 30<br>WebPaymentsCtrlr.SharedSecret is mysharedsecret<br>WebPaymentsCtrlr.Length is 8<br>WebPaymentsCtrlr.TOTPVersion is 1
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger CSMS to perform a payment and start a transaction via QR code webpage<br>maxenergy is 20000<br>qrUrl is <Configured QR base url> extended with:<br>{chargingstationId} is <omitted><br>{totp} is <valid totp><br>{evseId} is <configured evse><br>{version} is 1

    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. The CSMS does NOT send a RequestStartTransactionRequest
    Note over CSMS: Tool validations: N/a

    Note over CSMS: Post scenario validation:<br>CSMS detects that not all path parameters from URLTemplate are present<br>and shows a web page that QR code is not valid
    Note over CSMS: Post scenario validation:<br>CSMS doesn't forward EV Driver to a web page of PSP to enter payment credentials<br>and SHALL NOT authorize EV Driver to charge due missing chargingstationid URL parameter
